---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/nav/Breadcrumb.astro';

const effectiveDate = 'May 30, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | MazePuzzles.io"
  description="Read the terms for using MazePuzzles.io maze games, maze generator, printable maze worksheets, SVG downloads, and maze guides."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10">

    <Breadcrumb crumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Terms of Service' }]} />

    <!-- Hero -->
    <div class="mt-6 mb-10">
      <p
        class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-3"
        style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; color: var(--color-charcoal);"
      >Terms</p>
      <h1
        class="font-display text-5xl sm:text-6xl uppercase leading-none mb-4"
        style="color: var(--color-charcoal);"
      >Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-2" style="color: var(--color-charcoal);">
        These Terms of Service explain the rules for using MazePuzzles.io.
      </p>
      <p
        class="text-sm mt-3"
        style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; color: var(--color-muted-strong);"
      >Effective date: {effectiveDate}</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Sections -->
    <div
      class="border-t space-y-10 pt-8"
      style="border-color: var(--color-border);"
    >

      <section aria-labelledby="tos-using">
        <h2
          id="tos-using"
          class="font-bold text-lg mb-3"
          style="color: var(--color-charcoal);"
        >1. Using MazePuzzles.io</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-charcoal);">
          MazePuzzles.io provides maze games, maze generation tools, printable maze worksheets,
          SVG downloads, and maze guides. By using the site, you agree to use it responsibly and
          follow these terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="tos-personal-edu">
        <h2
          id="tos-personal-edu"
          class="font-bold text-lg mb-3"
          style="color: var(--color-charcoal);"
        >2. Free personal and educational use</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-charcoal);">
          You may use MazePuzzles.io for personal, classroom, homeschool, and non-commercial
          educational purposes. You may print mazes for students, family activities, personal
          practice, and similar uses.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="tos-commercial">
        <h2
          id="tos-commercial"
          class="font-bold text-lg mb-3"
          style="color: var(--color-charcoal);"
        >3. Commercial use</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-charcoal);">
          You may not sell, repackage, redistribute, or publish MazePuzzles.io mazes, downloads,
          screenshots, generated outputs, or site content as part of a paid product or commercial
          collection.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="tos-acceptable">
        <h2
          id="tos-acceptable"
          class="font-bold text-lg mb-3"
          style="color: var(--color-charcoal);"
        >4. Acceptable use</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-base" style="color: var(--color-charcoal);">
          <li>do not misuse the site or interfere with its operation</li>
          <li>do not attempt to overload, scrape, reverse engineer, or bypass limits</li>
          <li>do not use the site for unlawful or harmful purposes</li>
          <li>do not remove branding or claim the site's design, code, or content as your own</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="tos-generated">
        <h2
          id="tos-generated"
          class="font-bold text-lg mb-3"
          style="color: var(--color-charcoal);"
        >5. Generated mazes and printouts</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-charcoal);">
          Mazes generated or printed through MazePuzzles.io are provided for personal and
          educational use. Printable mazes and SVG downloads are provided as-is. You are responsible
          for checking that a printout or download works for your intended use.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="tos-progress">
        <h2
          id="tos-progress"
          class="font-bold text-lg mb-3"
          style="color: var(--color-charcoal);"
        >6. Progress and saved data</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-charcoal);">
          Some progress, streaks, or preferences may be saved locally in your browser.
          MazePuzzles.io does not guarantee that local progress will always be available.
          Clearing browser data, changing devices, or technical issues may remove saved progress.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="tos-ip">
        <h2
          id="tos-ip"
          class="font-bold text-lg mb-3"
          style="color: var(--color-charcoal);"
        >7. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-charcoal);">
          The MazePuzzles.io name, site design, software, text, layout, and original content are
          owned by the site owner or its licensors. These terms do not grant ownership of the site,
          brand, code, or content.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="tos-warranties">
        <h2
          id="tos-warranties"
          class="font-bold text-lg mb-3"
          style="color: var(--color-charcoal);"
        >8. No warranties</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-charcoal);">
          MazePuzzles.io is provided as-is. We try to keep the site available and accurate, but we
          do not guarantee uninterrupted access, error-free operation, or that every maze, printout,
          download, or guide will meet every user's needs.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="tos-liability">
        <h2
          id="tos-liability"
          class="font-bold text-lg mb-3"
          style="color: var(--color-charcoal);"
        >9. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-charcoal);">
          To the fullest extent permitted by law, MazePuzzles.io is not responsible for indirect,
          incidental, or consequential damages related to use of the site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="tos-changes">
        <h2
          id="tos-changes"
          class="font-bold text-lg mb-3"
          style="color: var(--color-charcoal);"
        >10. Changes to these terms</h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-charcoal);">
          We may update these Terms from time to time. The updated version will be posted on this
          page with a new effective date.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
